From: HAOS rk3588 <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: add Orange Pi 5B u-boot dtsi

The upstream rk3588s-orangepi-5b.dts has no U-Boot specific dtsi, so it
would fall back to rk3588-u-boot.dtsi (RK3588, not RK3588S). Add one that
uses rk3588s-u-boot.dtsi (SPL boot order: same-as-spl, SD, eMMC) and sets
the eMMC speed modes U-Boot supports, like the Orange Pi 5 Plus.

---
 arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-orangepi-5b-u-boot.dtsi | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-orangepi-5b-u-boot.dtsi

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-orangepi-5b-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-orangepi-5b-u-boot.dtsi
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-orangepi-5b-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+
+#include "rk3588s-u-boot.dtsi"
+
+&sdhci {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+	cap-mmc-highspeed;
+	mmc-hs200-1_8v;
+};
